imports: defaults.yaml
--- !node &Alpha
pub port: 1
# `E0223`. The member arrives — the resolved view is composed across file
# classes, because `<<` is YAML's and is governed in both — and it carries no
# endpoints, because a base YAML file declares nothing and none of its items
# was ever a reach. The endpoints belong in a `.yfy`.
--- !edge &FromData
<<: *Endpoints
